WEBVTT

00:11:58.627 --> 00:12:00.101
And he said, "What?"

00:12:00.841 --> 00:12:02.145
And I said, "A psychopath."

00:12:02.169 --> 00:12:06.548
And I said, "I've got a list
of psychopathic traits in my pocket.

00:12:06.572 --> 00:12:08.731
Can I go through them with you?"

00:12:09.393 --> 00:12:11.486
And he looked intrigued despite himself,

00:12:11.510 --> 00:12:12.885
and he said, "Okay, go on."

00:12:12.909 --> 00:12:16.292
And I said, "Okay.
Grandiose sense of self-worth."

00:12:16.316 --> 00:12:19.092
Which I have to say, would
have been hard for him to deny,

00:12:19.116 --> 00:12:22.500
because he was standing
under a giant oil painting of himself.

00:12:22.524 --> 00:12:26.675
(Laughter)

00:12:26.699 --> 00:12:29.732
He said, "Well, you've
got to believe in you!"

00:12:29.756 --> 00:12:32.644
And I said, "Manipulative."